{
  "allowlistVersion": "2.0.0",
  "_note": "Closed list of what a generator may set. allowlistVersion is MACHINE-CHECKED against registry.manifest.json by verify_all.py. Every id must have a matching contract file and every contract file an entry (parity is checked both ways). settableContentFields are cross-checked against each section's content contract. NOTE: the PageSpec schema has no style/token override field, so there is nothing token-related to allow (MASTER-GUIDE 3.21). 2.0.0: legal.body decomposed (legal.contents / legal.section / legal.document-footer), blog.prose is one chapter per node, 8 generation-safe asset roles, retrievalEligible mirrored per section (pinned in code). tokenOverrides: the closed page-level `tokens` slots (tokens/llm/token-policy.json) are the only token surface.",
  "tokenOverrides": "page-level only: PageSpec.tokens (closed slot set, values = approved token paths from tokens/llm/token-catalog.json, rules in tokens/llm/token-policy.json); no per-node style/token override",
